From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:07:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Route C shell: one app for the games, with each game's
 framework built on its own

build_ipa.sh DM_FRAMEWORK_ONLY=<folder> builds only the game's framework, DmGame<title ID>.framework, unsigned, with its shader
libraries, pipeline archive, launcher.json and icon inside, so one folder is one game. build_shell.sh generates the shell project
from project-shell.yml with every framework embedded and not linked, the host compiled from dm/host as in the one-game app and the
frontend-ios package linked as a local Swift package. dm/ios/Shell holds the shell's main, its scene, the library on ShellHost and
the real GameLauncher: Play sets the game's environment, dlopens its framework, hands the loader its mach header and starts the
host, then front_ios.m's game view takes the window. One game per process.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: the route C shell (M2): its library is the fork's frontend-ios package and its frameworks build on the route C patches 0046 to 0049, which wait for the runtime profile (seedds/nxnative#492)
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#144
